# Manager Frontend — AI Context

Before writing or modifying code, read:

1. `AGENTS.md` — project overview and doc references
2. `docs/PROJECT-STATUS.md` — current progress and next tasks
3. `docs/PROJECT-RULES.md` — coding conventions (when implementing code)

Use Cursor slash commands in `.cursor/commands/`:
- `/start` — begin session, read context
- `/new-feature` — scaffold new feature module
- `/write-tests` — write tests for existing module
- `/write-context` — create CONTEXT.md for a feature
- `/review-pr` — review code before commit
- `/update-status` — update PROJECT-STATUS.md at end of session

Stack: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite. API base: `/api/v1`.
